    {
      "heading": {
        "text": "SECTION 2 — HEAT EXCHANGERS",
        "level": 1
      },
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "NOTE: MARGIN pattern — all interpass and acid heat exchangers: All exchangers are in MARGIN at surge (85–91% of rated duty). This is consistent with the 20% over-design factor applied at sizing. No upsizing is required but all exchangers must be ordered with rated duty clearly specified as the 110% surge duty × 1.1 additional vendor margin. Vendors must confirm that fouling allowance (Rf = 0.0002 m²K/W for acid service) is included in the area calculation.",
